<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Al Shahriar Hossain Oni | Order Flow Trader</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: #050505;
      color: #f5f5f5;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #2b2108, #050505 55%);
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 48px;
      color: #d4af37;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .hero h2 {
      font-size: 24px;
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 750px;
      margin: auto;
      color: #cfcfcf;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      background: #d4af37;
      color: #000;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    section {
      padding: 70px 10%;
    }

    .title {
      color: #d4af37;
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
      gap: 25px;
    }

    .card {
      background: #111;
      border: 1px solid #2e2e2e;
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      border-color: #d4af37;
      transform: translateY(-5px);
    }

    .card h3 {
      color: #d4af37;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .card p, li {
      color: #cfcfcf;
    }

    ul {
      padding-left: 20px;
    }

    .strategy-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #111, #1f1805);
      border-left: 5px solid #d4af37;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
      background: #080808;
      color: #888;
      border-top: 1px solid #222;
    }

    .gold {
      color: #d4af37;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <div class="hero">
      <h1>Al Shahriar Hossain Oni</h1>
      <h2>Auction Market Theory & Order Flow Trader</h2>
      <p>
        I trade using Auction Market Theory, Market Profile, TPO, Volume Profile,
        Bookmap Heatmap, Liquidity, LVN, VAH, VAL, Delta, Absorption and Exhaustion.
        My focus is not prediction — my focus is reading market behaviour.
      </p>
      <a href="#strategy" class="btn">Explore My Strategy</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2 class="title">My Trading Foundation</h2>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Auction Market Theory</h3>
        <p>
          I study how price auctions between value and imbalance.
          Market moves from balance to imbalance, then searches for new value.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Volume Profile</h3>
        <p>
          I focus on VAH, VAL, POC, HVN and LVN to understand where the market
          accepts or rejects price.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Order Flow</h3>
        <p>
          I use footprint, delta, cumulative delta, imbalance and exhaustion
          to see buyer and seller aggression.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Bookmap Heatmap</h3>
        <p>
          I watch liquidity, absorption, spoofing behaviour and liquidity reactions
          before taking trades.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="strategy">
    <h2 class="title">My Trading Strategy</h2>

    <div class="strategy-box">
      <h3 class="gold">Core Idea</h3>
      <p>
        I do not blindly buy support or sell resistance. I wait for price to reach
        important auction levels such as LVN, VAH, VAL, previous high/low, liquidity
        zones or unfinished auction areas. Then I check order flow confirmation.
      </p>
      <br>

      <h3 class="gold">My Trade Checklist</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Is price trading near VAH, VAL, LVN, POC or liquidity zone?</li>
        <li>Is the market accepting or rejecting this price?</li>
        <li>Is heatmap liquidity pulling, stacking or absorbing?</li>
        <li>Is delta supporting the move or showing divergence?</li>
        <li>Is there exhaustion at the top or bottom?</li>
        <li>Is there a clean risk area for stop loss?</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="title">Markets I Focus On</h2>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Gold / XAUUSD / GC</h3>
        <p>
          My main focus is gold because it reacts strongly around liquidity,
          volume profile levels and macro fundamentals.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Bitcoin</h3>
        <p>
          I observe BTC structure, liquidity runs and auction behaviour,
          especially near major psychological levels.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Nasdaq & S&P</h3>
        <p>
          I use these markets to study risk sentiment, institutional order flow
          and intraday momentum.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="title">Trading Philosophy</h2>

    <div class="strategy-box">
      <p>
        Trading is not about indicators. Trading is about understanding where
        participants are trapped, where liquidity is resting, where value is accepted,
        and where the market is likely to reprice.
      </p>
      <br>
      <p>
        My goal is to trade like a professional: patient, selective, risk-focused
        and data-driven.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 Al Shahriar Hossain Oni | The Auction Room Bangladesh</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
